{comment: Verse 1}
Even [Bb]though she was a sinner
To [Gm]her that didn't really matter
[Eb]All she knew it was [Eb/F]Jesus she had to [Bb]see[Eb/F]
So she took her [Bb]box made of Alabaster
Poured the [Gm]oil on the feet of the master
